ike and favorite\n📨 Follow the game and come back for updates\n🤼 Play with friends!","path":"/game/6407649031-no-scope-arcade-new","slug":"6407649031-no-scope-arcade-new","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c6aeb67a458c2be30ec32ad9da8473cfc5a3df896eac2cb2730c3a3332038f4d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f67a7673e035a3f7ab9026062800b606/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":209906870,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-17T00:32:21.014Z","creator":{"name":"Iconic Gaming Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":27,"freeCount":26,"keyCount":5,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":10701984492,"name":"Orangutag! 🦧","desc":"We are working on a new game called \"Monke Tag\" which will be the sequel to Orangutag.\n\nFAQ:\nQ: Will Orangutag still be updated?\nA: Only for bug updates, but no new content updates.\n\nQ: When will Monke Tag be released?\nA: We have no release date as of now. If we do we will update this page to let you know :) For now we're still developing the game.\n\nQ: Will Monke Tag be different than Orangutag?\nA: Yes, so far they are absolutely nothing alike and Monke Tag will have more unique features.\n\nQ: What can I expect from Monke Tag?\nA: You can expect things like an Item Shop, Accessories, Game Modes, and we plan on adding much more!\n(When we say \"Accessories\" we're not talking about Avatar/Roblox Accessories) ","path":"/game/10701984492-orangutag","slug":"10701984492-orangutag","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c9cf633e13e653a98b7b1b5cf1cd31aaf5c65206ae5b5c8f3e32e456874bbdcd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f4f272854b2bee1a9719f9d6ce72830a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":18242365,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-03T16:37:32.075Z","creator":{"name":"Superluminal","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":13215924926,"name":"SCHOOL RP V3 [❄️🎄]","desc":"Welcome to SCHOOL RP V3 a game where u can fight eachother , at